ve publicly indicated they are evaluating LiDAR integration alongside camera systems after previously pursuing camera-primary approaches. Two of these programs remain in feasibility study phase.\"\n\n[Source 4 — Waymo Blog Post, \"Our Next Sensor Generation,\" December 2024]\nExcerpt: \"We are pleased to announce our sixth-generation sensor suite, which incorporates solid-state LiDAR modules alongside updated camera and radar arrays. The transition reflects our operational requirements in specific deployment corridors and may not represent an industry-wide design choice.\"\n\n---\nPlease produce: (1) a revised brief with all supported claims retained and bound to source pointers, and (2) an unsupported-claims log."